-/-!
-# The rational ray-class/cyclotomic comparison
-
-For `K = ℚ`, both the ray class quotient modulo `(m)` and the Galois
-group of the `m`-th cyclotomic field are canonically `(ℤ/mℤ)ˣ`.  This
