-The defining evaluation formula for `fieldNormMapLevelOfMapsFiltrationLevels` is
-`(fieldNormMapLevelOfMapsFiltrationLevels K L UK UL targetLevel hN n x : Kˣ) = normUnits K L
-x.1`.
