-/-- Second-isomorphism-style form of the ramification-kernel quotient:
-`(G_l/G_n)/(G_m/G_n) ≃ G_l/G_m`, for `l ≤ m ≤ n`. -/
-def quotientKernelQuotientSubgroupOfEquivQuotientKernelOfLe {l m n : ℕ}
